Eagly? I didn't mean to--

25:08.048 --> 25:09.758
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

25:37.744 --> 25:38.745
Eagly!

26:11.111 --> 26:12.112
He's inside.

26:12.529 --> 26:14.990
Yeah, we got the drones on it too,
Dunkin' Munchkin.

26:15.532 --> 26:16.700
You're not gonna call me that.

26:16.783 --> 26:19.035
Bro, we got a serious situation here.

26:19.119 --> 26:21.288
I don't need your whole PC,

26:21.371 --> 26:24.374
"the proper word for munchkin
is midget" bullshit.

26:24.457 --> 26:27.460
Munchkin means child, not little person,
asshole.

26:27.544 --> 26:30.046
Hey, how am I supposed
to know munchkin science, man?

26:30.130 --> 26:31.840
Let me make myself clear.

26:32.340 --> 26:34.050
You call me Dunkin’ Munchkins again

26:34.884 --> 26:36.303
and I will rip your dick off.

26:36.386 --> 26:39.347
Not metaphorically,
but actually rip your penis

26:39.431 --> 26:40.515
off your body

26:40.599 --> 26:43.018
in a move I learned from a blind monk
in the Himalayas.

26:43.560 --> 26:45.186
Seems like Flag knew what he was doing.

26:45.270 --> 26:47.814
I will get the troops together
and we'll be right there.

26:48.356 --> 26:49.816
Stellar work, Judomaster.

26:49.899 --> 26:51.401
Go fuck yourself.

26:51.484 --> 26:52.527
Okay.

26:54.154 --> 26:55.739
No, no, I knew it yesterday.

26:55.822 --> 26:56.823
I knew.

26:57.616 --> 26:58.700
What is it, Fleury?

27:00.744 --> 27:02.954
We have a location for the Peacemaker.

27:03.747 --> 27:05.123
All right, let's get moving.

27:24.559 --> 27:25.894
I'm gonna pretend you found that.

27:47.415 --> 27:49.709
It's from Chris. Fuck.

27:52.962 --> 27:54.005
What does it say?

28:32.293 --> 28:33.670
Ready for the next adventure, pal?

29:05.577 --> 29:06.578
Yeah.

29:09.330 --> 29:10.582
Fleury, can you hear me?

29:11.124 --> 29:12.751
Fleury, he's going into the rift!

29:15.587 --> 29:16.629
He...

29:17.630 --> 29:18.631
Fuck!

29:56.252 --> 29:58.963
God. He closed the portal behind him.

29:59.047 --> 30:00.381
He can never get back.

30:07.347 --> 30:08.473
Cheeto fingerprints.

30:08.556 --> 30:10.350
-What?
-Judomaster was here.

30:10.433 --> 30:12.352
They must have followed us here.

30:12.435 --> 30:14.521
The location is compromised.
We need to go.

30:14.604 --> 30:15.605
Okay.

30:17.273 --> 30:18.274
Wait.

30:24.739 --> 30:25.740
"I just..."

30:27.784 --> 30:29.452
-Chris, no!
-What does it say?

30:29.536 --> 30:30.662
We have to go.

30:31.204 --> 30:33.081
Call the others on the way.
We need to meet.

31:07.866 --> 31:10.201
There you are. Just in time.
Man, you gotta suit up.

31:10.285 --> 31:12.245
We got a kaiju downtown
tearing shit apart.

31:12.745 --> 31:13.788
What's with the bird?

31:13.872 --> 31:14.998
Rescue eagle.

31:16.291 --> 31:17.292
Name's Eagly.

31:17.750 --> 31:19.294
He's gonna be my sidekick from now on.

31:20.336 --> 31:22.505
Fucking Chrisper. Make it fast.

31:41.608 --> 31:45.570
"Ads, I'm trusting you to tell
the others goodbye for me."

31:46.237 --> 31:48.531
"I know you won't agree
with what I'm doing..."

31:48.615 --> 31:50.283
...but I feel like it's the right thing.

31:50.992 --> 31:53.661
I've tried again and again
to make up for my mistakes.

31:54.621 --> 31:57.332
But I'm not sure redemption
is something that's truly possible.

31:58.041 --> 31:59.375
At least not here.

32:01.085 --> 32:04.339
So... I'm going to make a life
in the other world.

32:04.881 --> 32:06.674
I'm going to be a brother to my brother...

32:08.051 --> 32:09.260
a son to my dad.

32:11.179 --> 32:13.097
And I'm going to tell Emilia, "Yes."

32:14.724 --> 32:15.934
"We'll work on this."

32:18.102 --> 32:19.312
I'll cherish life.

32:20.021 --> 32:22.106
And overcome my trauma
and be the good man there

32:22.190 --> 32:23.733
that I was never able to be here.

32:25.193 --> 32:26.361
Don't be bummed.

32:26.861 --> 32:27.904
I love you all.

32:28.738 --> 32:31.824
Even Harcourt after all that fucked-up,
cunty bullshit she did.

32:32.408 --> 32:33.660
But I don't belong here.

32:35.995 --> 32:38.706
I think that if you and Harcourt
and Economos

32:38.790 --> 32:42.168
turn this alien-dimensional-canister thing
over to ARGUS,

32:42.251 --> 32:44.712
you'll be in their good graces
enough to all get promoted.

32:47.298 --> 32:49.884
Then... everyone will be happy.

32:52.470 --> 32:54.764
Love, Chris. And Eagly.

33:20.873 --> 33:22.125
Adrian okay?

33:24.877 --> 33:27.755
Is it true you knocked out Chris
and turned him in to ARGUS?

33:27.839 --> 33:29.507
No, of course not.

33:30.299 --> 33:33.469
No, he was about to get shot in the head
by a PMSing cyborg,

33:33.553 --> 33:36.180
and the only way I could save his life
was by taking him down.

33:38.516 --> 33:39.600
What?

33:39.684 --> 33:41.310
You're just who I think you are, girl.

33:41.811 --> 33:43.229
And that's a good thing.

33:45.565 --> 33:47.066
You saw Chris use this thing?

33:47.608 --> 33:48.776
I think so.

33:48.860 --> 33:50.737
You just gotta line up the glass teeth

33:50.820 --> 33:52.947
in the right formation in a doorway,

33:53.031 --> 33:54.907
and you pull those switches,

33:54.991 --> 33:56.784
and you got yourself a connection.

34:01.706 --> 34:02.707
Come on.

34:03.207 --> 34:04.417
Where are you going?

34:04.917 --> 34:07.211
Well, we can't use it here.
ARGUS will find it.

34:07.295 --> 34:10.297
Use it? Why are we going to use it?

34:11.382 --> 34:12.925
Because we're gonna get Chris back.

34:15.094 --> 34:16.721
Maybe I can meet another me in there.

34:19.306 --> 34:20.475
Fuck me.

34:23.436 --> 34:24.520
Fuck!

36:08.082 --> 36:10.960
You know, manta ray derives from the Latin
for pancake of the sea.

36:11.043 --> 36:13.629
That's where we get the phrase,
"A manta ray never forgets."

36:13.713 --> 36:16.841
You know, when a manta ray is born,
they come out in the shape of a burrito.

36:18.092 --> 36:19.302
Can we go to Taco Bell?

36:19.385 --> 36:22.263
How many manta rays
does it take for you to shut the fuck up?

36:23.931 --> 36:26.809
-Is it four? Five?
-Let him count.

36:26.893 --> 36:29.395
Is it a murder of manta rays?
Are they even called a murder?

36:29.478 --> 36:32.648
-No, it's a school.
-Someone shoot me in the ass.

36:32.732 --> 36:34.859
What is that? Did you-- No.
